  "description": "Tango Groove is a joyful tribute to the funky, free-spirited typography of the ’60s and ’70s—perfectly infused with a modern digital twist. This layered retro bubble font bursts with personality through its bold curves, rounded forms, and shadowed depth. Its soft bubble-like structure and vibrant contrast make each character visually pop, amplifying every word with a cheerful, groovy attitude. With three stackable layer styles, Tango Groove allows designers to create dynamic 3D visuals effortlessly—ideal for capturing attention in branding, packaging, or playful posters.\nFrom retro music flyers to children’s product branding, this font radiates nostalgia and warmth while maintaining legibility. The outlines are thick and chunky, giving each letter a tactile look. Layering options add a delightful depth, making it feel custom and hand-crafted for your message. Whether you’re working on retro-themed merchandise, kids’ party invitations, or psychedelic poster art, Tango Groove delivers a visual rhythm that dances across the page and screen.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Tango Groove is a joyful tribute to the funky, free-spirited typography of the ’60s and ’70s—perfectly infused with a modern digital twist. This layered retro bubble font bursts with personality through its bold curves, rounded forms, and shadowed depth. Its soft bubble-like structure and vibrant contrast make each character visually pop, amplifying every word with a cheerful, groovy attitude. With three stackable layer styles, Tango Groove allows designers to create dynamic 3D visuals effortlessly—ideal for capturing attention in branding, packaging, or playful posters.</p>\n<p>From retro music flyers to children’s product branding, this font radiates nostalgia and warmth while maintaining legibility. The outlines are thick and chunky, giving each letter a tactile look. Layering options add a delightful depth, making it feel custom and hand-crafted for your message. Whether you’re working on retro-themed merchandise, kids’ party invitations, or psychedelic poster art, Tango Groove delivers a visual rhythm that dances across the page and screen.</p>",
